-10-26","zh":"每週回顧：強勁的現金產生能力和 2026 年第三季獲利優於預期，股價上漲"},{"title":"SLB Stock Climbs As Mega Contracts And Digital Deal Hit","src":"Timothy Sykes","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTFAzbklnQXVmeFZqMmtuZnAxYjRqYmllVkItUHFOVkZmd3RlcWNyN3FEeXllX1d6QVlCWnNPVFZwRV9fclYxR0lmSGVacWVyY0JYUHhqWDZ6ZWdvTjdtWmhfb1BTZnVFSzFQR0FaVS1iM1RsaDZi?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"隨著大型合約和數位交易的衝擊，SLB 股價上漲"},{"title":"SLB Stock Climbs As New Mega Contracts Power Momentum","src":"StocksToTrade","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTFBId0dCRFlpWDVQeWRwRWEtX3YycjBZZzNvZFhScEw1QVZ0Nk1VQ0NQVjFCUnVlMzJzN1diWEZ3M0VRem02UG5UTTdlbzZwMG5CNmdONVBSdGZISGFGcG9IdjZfdlIwTUpXUzF3cHA1blM?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"新的大型合約推動 SLB 股價上漲"},{"title":"SLB (SLB) director Ulrich Jing reports zero direct common stock holdings as of October 5, 2026.","src":"Stock Titan","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNUmhmclFDN3pianpfY255SEgzS0pxN3ExbnRxdWFEcnFMdGcxZllrTFBIdk9NbF9YWkY5SEU3T0dTSGxJd2s4TVRUX1R5TGFiMnpOVFFsVXpzcUYxd2lkaFcyR3dMVE1uQXNZRTBaazFMZl9yVEZycnRkSVBMN3NHLXJVZFdZNEZHT2ZOVjc5YWpsbGk0bG82eTdhREtKSUhfR2VRLXJlYTZkU0p4d2YzVklqZmFwUThLTnhDRS11V3N5dw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-13","zh":"SLB (SLB) 董事 Ulrich Jing 報告稱，截至 2026 年 10 月 5 日，直接持有普通股為零。"}],"themes":[{"name":"能源/電力","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-01-23","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/87347/000119312526021017/slb-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"SLB is a global technology company driving energy innovation for a balanced planet. With a global presence in more than 100 countries and employees representing almost twice as many nationalities, we work each day on innovating energy technology, delivering digital at scale, decarbonizing industries, and developing and scaling new energy systems that accelerate the energy transition.","zh":"SLB 是一家全球科技公司，致力於推動能源創新，實現地球平衡。我們的業務遍及全球 100 多個國家，員工國籍幾乎是其兩倍，我們每天致力於創新能源技術、大規模數位化、產業脫碳以及開發和擴展新能源系統，以加速能源轉型。"},{"en":"The world faces the challenge of providing secure and affordable energy to meet growing demand, while rapidly decarbonizing for a sustainable future. With nearly a century of market and technology leadership, SLB is well positioned and committed to being a leader in providing solutions to address this trilemma.","zh":"世界面臨著提供安全且負擔得起的能源以滿足不斷增長的需求，同時快速脫碳以實現永續未來的挑戰。憑藉近一個世紀的市場和技術領先地位，SLB 處於有利地位，並致力於成為解決這一難題的解決方案的領導者。"},{"en":"SLB is primarily organized under four Divisions that combine and integrate SLB's technologies, enhancing our ability to support the emerging long-term growth opportunities in each of these market segments. The four Divisions are:","zh":"SLB 主要由四個部門組成，這些部門結合併整合了 SLB 的技術，從而增強了我們支持每個細分市場中新興長期成長機會的能力。這四個部門是："}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"SLB's primary customers are national oil companies, large integrated oil companies, and independent operators. No single customer exceeded 10% of SLB's consolidated revenue during each of 2025, 2024, and 2023.","zh":"SLB的主要客戶是國家石油公司、大型綜合石油公司和獨立營運商。 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年期間，沒有任何單一客戶超過 SLB 合併收入的 10%。"},{"en":"SLB is subject to numerous environmental and other governmental and regulatory requirements related to its operations worldwide. For additional details see \"Item 1(a). Risk Factors – Legal and Regulatory Risks,\" which is incorporated by reference in this Item 1.","zh":"SLB 須遵守與其全球營運相關的眾多環境及其他政府和監管要求。有關更多詳細資訊，請參閱“第 1(a) 項。風險因素 – 法律和監管風險”，該內容通過引用併入本第 1 項中。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The principal methods of competition within the energy services industry are technological innovation, quality of service, and price differentiation. These factors vary geographically and are dependent upon the different services and products that SLB offers. SLB has numerous competitors, both large and small.","zh":"能源服務業的主要競爭方式是技術創新、服務品質和價格差異化。這些因素因地理位置而異，並且取決於 SLB 提供的不同服務和產品。 SLB 有許多大大小小的競爭對手。"},{"en":"SLB owns or controls one of the industry's leading portfolios of intellectual property, including but not limited to patents, proprietary information, trade secrets, and software tools and applications that, in the aggregate, are material to SLB's business. While SLB seeks and holds a significant number of patents covering various products and processes, no particular patent or group of patents is material to SLB's business.","zh":"SLB 擁有或控制業界領先的智慧財產權組合之一，包括但不限於專利、專有資訊、商業機密以及整體上對 SLB 業務至關重要的軟體工具和應用程式。雖然 SLB 尋求並持有大量涉及各種產品和製程的專利，但沒有任何特定專利或專利組對 SLB 的業務具有實質意義。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Production Systems","val":13325000000,"zh":"生產系統"},{"name":"Well Construction","val":11856000000,"zh":"油井施工"},{"name":"Reservoir Performance","val":6820000000,"zh":"油藏表現"},{"name":"Digital Integration","val":2660000000,"zh":"數位整合"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":1987000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":35708000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service","val":21200000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Product","val":14508000000,"zh":"產品"}],"total":35708000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Non Us","val":27942000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"Middle East","val":12218000000,"zh":"中東"},{"name":"Europe Africa","val":9572000000,"zh":"Europe Africa"},{"name":"North America","val":7515000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":6300000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Latin America","val":6152000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":251000000,"zh":"其他國家"}],"total":35708000000}},"peers":["HAL","RIG","COP","OXY","DVN"]}}